                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Heard a lot about this game when it released and regret waiting for so long to try this gem.\n\nDelivers exactly what it advertises, no more and no less.\nA series of beautifully modelled and intuitively designed puzzle boxes with a side of a story that even manages to take a cool unexpected turn.\n\nWell worth its price.",
